On Mon, 24 Nov 2003 11:18:06 +0100
Harald Welte <laforge@netfilter.org> wrote:

Hi, Harald.

> You could maybe add a '--log' option to the match or whatever... but I
> really don't think it's a good idea to have the same code replicated
> as match and as target.

Here is patch.

It adds:
 - new parameter for matching: --log 1/0. 
	If present, OSF will log determined genres even if they don't match
	desired one.	
	0 - log all determined entries, 
	1 - only first one.
 - new parameter: --smart
  	if present, OSF will use some smartness to determine remote OS
	Now only not use TTL( with it far remote machines can be determined).

Please test and apply.

> -- 
> - Harald Welte <laforge@netfilter.org>            
> http://www.netfilter.org/


